PASS control K4 the revised matrix is positive definite
PASS control K4 C_PL5D is positive semidefinite and of rank 2
PASS control K5 the correlation is the revised matrix's, symmetric, within [-1, 1], with a unit diagonal
PASS control K5 the without matrix's relative sigma is the committed product's
